WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.405 --> 00:00:04.425
<v Avery>I need to cancel.

2
00:00:04.895 --> 00:00:08.824
<v AI agent>I can cancel your primary care appointment on Thursday,

3
00:00:08.904 --> 00:00:11.895
<v AI agent>May 21 at 10:15 AM. Should I cancel it?

4
00:00:12.459 --> 00:00:14.279
<v Avery>Yes, please cancel it.

5
00:00:14.772 --> 00:00:17.540
<v AI agent>Your appointment is cancelled,

6
00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:21.511
<v AI agent>and the time is now open for another patient.

7
00:00:21.591 --> 00:00:25.562
<v AI agent>To book a new visit, call us at 206-555-0100.

8
00:00:27.033 --> 00:00:29.113
<v Narrator>Appointment reminder agent.

9
00:00:29.567 --> 00:00:36.017
<v Narrator>It calls before the visit. Confirm, change or cancel, before the slot is lost.

10
00:00:39.722 --> 00:00:40.412
<v Jordan>Hello?

11
00:00:40.492 --> 00:00:43.459
<v AI agent>Hi, this is Contoso Health's automated assistant,

12
00:00:43.539 --> 00:00:45.864
<v AI agent>calling with an appointment reminder.

13
00:00:45.944 --> 00:00:47.762
<v AI agent>Am I speaking with Jordan?

14
00:00:49.310 --> 00:00:50.850
<v Jordan>Yes, this is Jordan.

15
00:00:51.362 --> 00:00:52.391
<v AI agent>Thanks, Jordan.

16
00:00:52.471 --> 00:00:55.702
<v AI agent>To protect your privacy, please tell me your date of birth.

17
00:00:56.281 --> 00:00:58.671
<v Jordan>March 12th, 1984.

18
00:00:59.104 --> 00:01:03.209
<v AI agent>You have an imaging appointment with Dr. Lee on Thursday,

19
00:01:03.289 --> 00:01:06.574
<v AI agent>May 21 at 9:30 AM, at the Northgate clinic.

20
00:01:10.908 --> 00:01:12.388
<v Jordan>Yes, I'll be there.

21
00:01:12.822 --> 00:01:13.973
<v AI agent>You're confirmed.

22
00:01:14.053 --> 00:01:15.203
<v AI agent>Please do not eat

23
00:01:15.283 --> 00:01:17.271
<v AI agent>or drink anything except water for

24
00:01:17.351 --> 00:01:19.240
<v AI agent>8 hours before your appointment,

25
00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:21.092
<v AI agent>and arrive 15 minutes early.

26
00:01:25.319 --> 00:01:26.769
<v Riley>Can I come next week instead?

27
00:01:27.189 --> 00:01:30.350
<v AI agent>I'll connect you with our scheduling team to find a new time.

28
00:01:30.430 --> 00:01:33.779
<v AI agent>Your current appointment stays booked until you choose a new one.

29
00:01:33.859 --> 00:01:34.799
<v AI agent>Please hold.

30
00:01:36.363 --> 00:01:37.791
<v Camila's voicemail>Hi, you've reached Camila.

31
00:01:37.871 --> 00:01:39.913
<v Camila's voicemail>Please leave a message after the tone.

32
00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:43.210
<v AI agent>This is Contoso Health calling for

33
00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:46.378
<v AI agent>Camila with an appointment reminder.

34
00:01:46.458 --> 00:01:49.626
<v AI agent>Please call us back at 602-555-0100.

35
00:01:50.933 --> 00:01:52.393
<v Narrator>The agent asks.

36
00:01:52.833 --> 00:01:54.353
<v Narrator>The server checks.

37
00:01:58.133 --> 00:01:59.193
<v Narrator>Make it yours.

38
00:01:59.633 --> 00:02:07.553
<v Narrator>Your calling hours, reminder window and scripts are configuration. Your coding agent can change the rest.

39
00:02:10.533 --> 00:02:13.263
<v Narrator>Run it in simulation in two minutes.

40
00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:17.500
<v Narrator>Then connect your clinic's number and Teams.
